language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ Find three integers between 1 and 10 such that every given number is a sum of a non-empty subset of them.
given numbers : matrix indexed by [int(1..4)] of int(1..10)
find x : matrix indexed by [int(1..3)] of int(1..10)
find inSubset : matrix indexed by [int(1..4), int(1..3)] of bool
such that
$ each given number is the sum of the chosen elements of x
forAll k : int(1..4) . (sum j : int(1..3) . toInt(inSubset[k, j]) * x[j]) = numbers[k],
$ each given number is generated by a non-empty subset
forAll k : int(1..4) . exists j : int(1..3) . inSubset[k, j]
